  "claim_short": "Candidate full answers to Questions 3.2 and 3.4 of arXiv:2602.19599. For the source involution S_A=[[A,I+A],[I-A,-A]], conjugation by the fixed block Hadamard matrix gives [[I,0],[2A,-I]]. An exact two-variable Rayleigh quotient proves ||S_A||=||A||+sqrt(1+||A||^2). Therefore every contraction has a scalar-field-preserving involutory dilation in dimension 2n with norm at most 1+sqrt2, sharply improving the source...",
